        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Awards: Order of Maternal Glory\n- People: Joseph Stalin\n- Organizations: Presidium of the Supreme Soviet of the USSR\n- Places: USSR\n\nFacts:\n- Joseph Stalin was born on 18 December 1878 and died on 5 March 1953.\n- Joseph Stalin was a Georgian-born Soviet revolutionary and political leader.\n- The Order of Maternal Glory was a Soviet civilian award created on 8 July 1944 by Joseph Stalin.\n- The Presidium of the Supreme Soviet of the USSR established the Order of Maternal Glory with a decision on 8 July 1944.",
